{"blocks": [
{"id": "r1", "winner": "B", "why": "Draft B's visible passages contain all seven required sections (产品参数, 配件明细, 操作指南, 保养建议, 安全须知, 常见问题解决办法, 保修条款) with actual content, while Draft A's 配件明细 appears only as a table-of-contents entry with no body text."},
{"id": "r2", "winner": "A", "why": "Draft A consistently uses warm, respectful phrasing (如“感谢您选择”“祝您拥有愉快的智能生活体验”) and explanatory sentences, whereas Draft B's terse imperative bullets and checklists read more like a form than a friendly guide."},
{"id": "r3", "winner": "B", "why": "Draft B's passages use fewer unexplained technical terms, while Draft A's product spec list stacks unexplained jargon such as 锂聚合物电池, PPG心率传感器, BLE, TPU and PC+ABS."},
{"id": "r4", "winner": "A", "why": "Draft A explicitly states the IP67 rating with the scope limit and names swimming, diving and hot showers/sauna as excluded, whereas Draft B's “生活防水” label is vaguer even though its 不可以 list also covers swimming and diving."},
{"id": "r5", "winner": "A", "why": "Draft A gives dedicated sections for sleep quality analysis (monitoring, viewing reports) and mobile payment (binding and usage steps), while Draft B's coverage is shorter and more generic."},
{"id": "r6", "winner": "B", "why": "Draft B's visible parameters and steps are concrete and mostly consistent, while Draft A's spec list has unfilled template placeholders with alternative values and its 防水 section ends in an incomplete “这意味着：” lead-in, though Draft B's 电源键 vs 侧边按键 mismatch is a minor flaw."}
]}
